[00:00.00] Wrong now comes to sit
[00:07.00] In her garden, mingling the breeze with memories
[00:17.00] Of a time when there was a room in pale yellow use
[00:26.00] A room with a view where love made a bed of happiness
[00:36.00] In muslin and lace
[00:41.00] Sweet is the voice from far away
[00:56.00] That speaks out of old shame
[01:00.00] And is lingering there in the golden air
[01:06.00] To quiet the day
